    "title": "INDOT: 1 dead after crash on I-465 in Marion County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sam Maurer ,\n3 hours ago\nINDIANAPOLIS — One person is dead and another was transported to a hospital after a multi-vehicle crash in Marion County on Wednesday night.\nAccording to an INDOT Traffic Management Center alert at 8:58 p.m., the 3 right lanes are closed on I-465 northbound near mile marker 37.8 by East 71st Street.\nPhoto provided by INDOT According to the Indiana State Police, three vehicles were involved, including a semi truck.\nThe cause of the crash is still under investigation.\nThis is a developing story; check back for updates.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Fox 59.",
